  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 72 × 3 + 48 ÷ 6 - 16 = 296\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the two signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : × and + \n\n72 × 3 + 48 ÷ 6 - 16 = 296 ⇒ 72 + 3 × **48 ÷ 6**__ - 16 = 296\n\n72 + __**3 **____**× **____8__ - 16 = 296\n\n__**72 + **__**__24__** - 16 = 296\n\n__**96 - 16**__ = 296\n\n \n\n80 ≠ 296 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : × and ÷ \n\n72 × 3 + 48 ÷ 6 - 16 = 296 ⇒ **72 ÷ 3**__ + 48 × 6 - 16 = 296\n\n24 + __**48 **____**×**____** 6**__ - 16 = 296\n\n__**24 + **__**__288__** - 16 = 296\n\n__**312 - 16**__ = 296\n\n**296 = 296 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : + and -\n\n72 × 3 + 48 ÷ 6 - 16 = 296 ⇒ 72 × 3 - **48 ÷ 6**__ + 16 = 296\n\n__**72 × 3**__ - 8 + 16 = 296\n\n__**216 **____**+ 16**__ - 8 = 296\n\n__**232 - 8**__ = 296\n\n224 ≠ 296 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : ÷ and - \n\n72 × 3 + 48 ÷ 6 - 16 = 296 ⇒ 72 × 3 + 48 - **6 ÷ 16**__ = 296\n\n__**72 × 3**__ + 48 - 0.375 = 296\n\n__**216 + 48**__ - 0.375 = 296\n\n__**264 - 0.375**__ = 296\n\n263.625 ≠ 296 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.",
